      "sentence": "The authors know exactly what modifications to make and how to apply them.",
      "error_type": "factual_error",
      "explanation": "The main requested actions (systematic causal analysis, root cause study of why/when selfMoA outperforms Mixed MoA) have no concrete details on how to execute them, so authors do not know exactly how to apply the requested changes. This claim contradicts the content of the evaluated text."
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Therefore, the comment is fully actionable with explicit actions and concrete details.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "The comment explicitly states the required actions but lacks concrete details for executing most requested actions, which matches the rubric criteria for a score of 3, not 5. The rationale incorrectly applies the higher score threshold for 5 when the criteria are not met."
    }
